#: calwizard.cpp:84
msgid "Create Template for Calendar"
msgstr "Kalennervörlaag opstellen"

#: calwizard.cpp:90
msgid "Choose the events to show on the Calendar"
msgstr "Binnen Kalenner wieste Begeefnissen utsöken"

#: calwizard.cpp:96
msgid "Select Year & Images"
msgstr "Johr un Biller utsöken"

#: calwizard.cpp:154
msgid "Current Page"
msgstr "Aktuell Siet"

#: calwizard.cpp:160
msgid "Total Pages"
msgstr "Sieden tosamen"

#: calwizard.cpp:167
msgid "Printing"
msgstr "Drucken"

#: calwizard.cpp:174
msgid "Calendar"
msgstr "Kalenner"

#: calwizard.cpp:177
msgid "A Kipi plugin to create a calendar"
msgstr "En KIPI-Moduul, mit dat Du en Kalenner opstellen kannst"

#: calwizard.cpp:180
msgid "Author and maintainer"
msgstr "Autor un Pleger"

#: calwizard.cpp:183
msgid "Former Author and maintainer"
msgstr "Verleden Autor un Pleger"

#: calwizard.cpp:189
msgid "Calendar Handbook"
msgstr "Kalenner-Handbook"

#: calwizard.cpp:258
msgid ""
"Please note that you are making a calendar for"
"<br>the current year or a year in the past."
msgstr ""
"Beacht: Du büst bi un maakst en Kalenner för dit"
"<br>oder en verleden Johr."

#: calwizard.cpp:263
msgid ""
"<br>"
"<br>You can see KJobViewer is already started. After the plugin has prepared "
"the calendar, it is passed to the PDF printer. In the KJobViewer you can see "
"the progress of that part of the generation of the calendar."
msgstr ""
"<br>"
"<br>De Opgavenkieker löppt al, as Du sehn kannst. Wenn dat Moduul den Kalenner opstellt hett, gifft dat em na den PDF-Drucker. Dat Vörankamen bi dissen Deel vun't Opstellen vun den Kalenner kannst Du in den Opgavenkieker ankieken."

#: calwizard.cpp:268
msgid ""
"Click Next to start Printing"
"<br>"
"<br>Following months will be printed for year %1:"
msgstr ""
"Klick op \"Nakamen\", wenn Du dat Drucken anfangen wullt"
"<br>"
"<br>Disse Maanden warrt för't Johr %1 druckt:"

#: calwizard.cpp:277
msgid "No valid images selected for months<br>Click Back to select images"
msgstr "Du hest för de Maanden keen gellen Biller utsöcht<br>Klick op \"Torüch\", wenn Du Biller utsöken wullt."

#: calwizard.cpp:329
msgid "Printing Cancelled"
msgstr "Drucken afbraken"

#: calwizard.cpp:346
msgid "Printing Complete"
msgstr "Drucken afslaten"

#: calwizard.cpp:361 calwizard.cpp:365
msgid "Printing Calendar Page for %1 of %2"
msgstr "De Kalennersiet för %1 vun %2 warrt druckt"

#: plugin_calendar.cpp:60
msgid "Create Calendar..."
msgstr "Kalenner opstellen..."

